{
    "chapter_num": 15,
    "verses_count": 47,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Faces Pilate"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Immediately, in the morning, the chief priests held a consultation with the elders and scribes and the whole council; and they bound Jesus, led "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " away, and delivered "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Pilate. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Pilate asked Him, “Are You the King of the Jews?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He answered and said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“It is as you say.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the chief priests accused Him of many things, but He answered nothing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Pilate asked Him again, saying, “Do You answer nothing? See how many things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU of which they accuse You"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "they testify against You!” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jesus still answered nothing, so that Pilate marveled."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Taking the Place of Barabbas"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now at the feast he was accustomed to releasing one prisoner to them, whomever they requested. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And there was one named Barabbas, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " chained with his fellow rebels; they had committed murder in the rebellion. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the multitude, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU going up"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "crying aloud, began to ask "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him to do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " just as he had always done for them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Pilate answered them, saying, “Do you want me to release to you the King of the Jews?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he knew that the chief priests had handed Him over because of envy."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the chief priests stirred up the crowd, so that he should rather release Barabbas to them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pilate answered and said to them again, “What then do you want me to do "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "with Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " whom you call the King of the Jews?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they cried out again, “Crucify Him!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Pilate said to them, “Why, what evil has He done?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But they cried out all the more, “Crucify Him!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Pilate, wanting to gratify the crowd, released Barabbas to them; and he delivered Jesus, after he had scourged "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to be crucified."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Soldiers Mock Jesus"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the soldiers led Him away into the hall called "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The governor’s headquarters"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Praetorium, and they called together the whole garrison. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they clothed Him with purple; and they twisted a crown of thorns, put it on His "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "head,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and began to salute Him, “Hail, King of the Jews!” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they struck Him on the head with a reed and spat on Him; and bowing the knee, they worshiped Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when they had mocked Him, they took the purple off Him, put His own clothes on Him, and led Him out to crucify Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The King on a Cross"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they compelled a certain man, Simon a Cyrenian, the father of Alexander and Rufus, as he was coming out of the country and passing by, to bear His cross. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they brought Him to the place Golgotha, which is translated, Place of a Skull. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they gave Him wine mingled with myrrh to drink, but He did not take "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when they crucified Him, they divided His garments, casting lots for them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to determine"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " what every man should take."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it was the third hour, and they crucified Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the inscription of His "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "crime"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "accusation was written above:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "THE KING OF THE JEWS."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "With Him they also crucified two robbers, one on His right and the other on His left. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits v. 28."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the Scripture was fulfilled which says, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“And He was numbered with the transgressors.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And those who passed by blasphemed Him, wagging their heads and saying, “Aha! "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "You"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who destroy the temple and build "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in three days, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "save Yourself, and come down from the cross!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Likewise the chief priests also, mocking among themselves with the scribes, said, “He saved others; Himself He cannot save. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let the Christ, the King of Israel, descend now from the cross, that we may see and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M believe Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "believe.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Even those who were crucified with Him reviled Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Dies on the Cross"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when the sixth hour had come, there was darkness over the whole land until the ninth hour. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And at the ninth hour Jesus cried out with a loud voice, saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Eloi, Eloi, lama sabachthani?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " which is translated, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“My God, My God, why have You forsaken Me?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Some of those who stood by, when they heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said, “Look, He is calling for Elijah!” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then someone ran and filled a sponge full of sour wine, put "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on a reed, and offered "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Him to drink, saying, “Let Him alone; let us see if Elijah will come to take Him down.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus cried out with a loud voice, and breathed His last."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the veil of the temple was torn in two from top to bottom. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So when the centurion, who stood opposite Him, saw that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU He thus breathed His last"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He cried out like this and breathed His last, he said, “Truly this Man was the Son of God!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There were also women looking on from afar, among whom were Mary Magdalene, Mary the mother of James the Less and of Joses, and Salome, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who also followed Him and ministered to Him when He was in Galilee, and many other women who came up with Him to Jerusalem."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Buried in Joseph’s Tomb"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when evening had come, because it was the Preparation Day, that is, the day before the Sabbath, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Joseph of Arimathea, a prominent council member, who was himself waiting for the kingdom of God, coming and taking courage, went in to Pilate and asked for the body of Jesus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 44,
                    "num_str": "44",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pilate marveled that He was already dead; and summoning the centurion, he asked him if He had been dead for some time. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 45,
                    "num_str": "45",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So when he found out from the centurion, he granted the body to Joseph. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 46,
                    "num_str": "46",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he bought fine linen, took Him down, and wrapped Him in the linen. And he laid Him in a tomb which had been hewn out of the rock, and rolled a stone against the door of the tomb. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 47,
                    "num_str": "47",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Mary Magdalene and Mary "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the mother"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Joses observed where He was laid."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}